WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.148
In this first step, choose

2
00:00:02.148 --> 00:00:04.284
a housing situation to explore.

3
00:00:04.284 --> 00:00:07.047
You might live with family, share a place,

4
00:00:07.047 --> 00:00:09.926
rent your own apartment, or consider a home.

5
00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:13.038
There’s no right answer, and choosing an

6
00:00:13.038 --> 00:00:15.000
option doesn’t lock you into it.

7
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.250
Each choice simply changes the monthly estimate.

8
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.027
Use the starting number or adjust

9
00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:21.849
it to better reflect your situation.

10
00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:25.634
This is a safe place to compare possibilities.
